| **PROVED from Merikoski**, ($1/2,18/19$) | $19/36=0.527778$ | $19/27-(19/18)\delta=0.703704-1.055556\delta$ | $133/180-(19/18)\delta=0.738889-1.055556\delta$ | $z<p\le z^{19/18+o(1)}$ |
| **PROVED conditional arithmetic**, Haugland ($1/2+,24/25-$) | $25/48+=0.520833+$ | $25/36-(25/24)\delta+=0.694444-1.041667\delta+$ | $35/48-(25/24)\delta+=0.729167-1.041667\delta+$ | $z<p\le z^{25/24+o_\varepsilon(1)+O(\varepsilon)}$ |
