      (both referees).
    - Hence w̄_g ≍ h(v)P/M². For composite M the activity is ≈ 2^{−ω(M)} with 2^{ω(M)}
      roots, which gives the same estimate.
    - π_g ≍ 1/M needs Brun–Titchmarsh over the prime population, valid for M ≤ P^{1−ε}.
